OL,3,GNEWSA'Relief' for Lough Neagh eel
OL,4,Afishers with #700k support package
OL,5,
OL,6,FA financial package to support eel
OL,7,Ffishers on Lough Neagh has been
OL,8,Funveiled, with a small number of
OL,9,Fspecialist hauliers also to be
OL,10,Feligible.
OL,12,FIt follows the closure of the
OL,13,Fyellow/brown eel fishery, announced
OL,14,Fearlier this year.
OL,16,FThe #700,000 Lough Neagh Eel Fishery
OL,17,FTransition Scheme will run for three
OL,18,Fyears.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,419,410,260,120,0,100
